# Memory Trick

- `[]` → These characters
- `[^...]` → Everything **except** these characters
- `a-z` → Lowercase letters
- `A-Z` → Uppercase letters
- `0-9` → Digits
- `\\d` → Digit
- `\\D` → Not a digit
- `\\s` → Whitespace
- `\\S` → Not whitespace
- `\\w` → Word character (`a-zA-Z0-9_`)
- `\\W` → Not a word character

## One-Line Rule

> **First decide what you want to KEEP. Write those inside `[]`. Add `^` if you want to remove everything else.**
